# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**CSP & Canonical Domains:** Hooks into platform CSP/SSL/domain management to keep policies strict and URLs stable."
msgstr "**CSP & Canonical Domains:** Haken an der Plattform CSP/SSL/domain Management, um Richtlinien streng und URLs stabil zu halten."

