# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "**Service Management:** Provides handlers to restart the Wireguard service and reload sysctl settings."
msgstr "**Service Management:** Stellt Handler bereit, um den Wireguard-Dienst neu zu starten und sysctl-Einstellungen neu zu laden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
