# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "INFINITO_TOR_SOCKS_PORT: node Tor SOCKS port, read from the single source of truth in svc-net-tor's meta/services.yml (services.tor.ports.local.socks). Keeps shell consumers (e.g. the Playwright rerunner) off a hard-coded port literal."
msgstr "INFINITO_TOR_SOCKS_PORT: Knoten Tor SOCKS Port, gelesen von der Single Source of Truth in svc-net-tor's meta/services.yml (services.tor.ports.local.socks). Haltet Shell-Konsumenten (z.B. der Playwright Rerunner) Aus einem fest codierten Port Literal."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "INFINITO_WORKER_CPU * 20, with a base of 1 collapsing to 1 (the operator's sequential-fallback signal). Consumed by URL probers and upstream tag fetchers."
msgstr "INFINITO_WORKER_CPU * 20, mit einer Basis von 1 kollabiert zu 1 (das sequentielle Rückfallsignal des Operators). Verbraucht von URL-Sonden und Upstream-Tag-Fetchern."

