# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The `pre-commit` hooks are installed automatically by `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-machine overrides go into the process environment before invoking `make` (e.g. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` honors caller-set values via setdefault semantics."
msgstr "Die `pre-commit` Haken werden automatisch von `make environment-bootstrap`. Per-Machine-Overrides gehen in die Prozessumgebung vor dem Aufrufen `make` (z.B. `export INFINITO_FOO=…`); `make dotenv` ehrt Caller-Set-Werte über setdefault Semantik."

