# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "The onion identity (key files) is minted/reused by ``cli.administration.inventory.onion``; this provisioner is the single spot that writes the resulting address into ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` of the host_vars — so consumers read it via ``lookup('config', 'svc-net-tor', 'services.tor.node')`` with no env indirection."
msgstr "Die Zwiebelidentität (Schlüsseldateien) wird durch ``cli.administration.inventory.onion``; dieser Provisioner ist der einzige Ort, der die resultierende Adresse in ``applications.svc-net-tor.services.tor.node`` von host_vars Verbraucher lesen es über ``lookup('config', 'svc-net-tor', 'services.tor.node')`` ohne Env-Indirektion."

# translated-by: libretranslate
