# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; swarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (shared-overlay alias) for the app frontend, or ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` for named sidecars (sso-proxy). A ``host_gateway`` app runs node-local under swarm and publishes its local port to the host, so the overlay-attached proxy reaches it at ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` via the host gateway (the caller sets this off the real DEPLOYMENT_MODE, since such apps force a compose-style render). Missing swarm internal port hard-fails."
msgstr "Upstream ``host:port``: compose ``127.0.0.1:<local>``; Schwarm ``<entity>:<internal>`` (Shared-Overlay Aliasname) für das App-Frontend oder ``<entity>_<service_key>:<internal>`` für benannte Beiwagen (sso-Proxy)A ``host_gateway`` App läuft node-local unter Schwarm und veröffentlicht seinen lokalen Port zum Host, so dass der Overlay-attached Proxy ihn bei ``host.docker.internal:<local>`` über das Host Gateway (Der Anrufer setzt dies aus dem realen DEPLOYMENT_MODE, da solche Apps ein Compos-Style-Rendering erzwingen)Fehlende Schwarm-interne Port-Hard-Fails."

