msgid "You MUST use [RFC 2119](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2119) keywords in all documentation to express requirement levels unambiguously:"
msgstr "Sie müssen verwenden [RFC 2119](https://www.rfc-editor.org/rfc/rfc2119) Schlüsselwörter in allen Dokumentationen, um Anforderungsniveaus eindeutig auszudrücken:"

