# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "a YAML mapping that mirrors the assembled application payload, so it can override anything reachable under `applications.<app>.<root>` (see [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md)). Every root is the name of a `meta/` topic — `services`, `server`, `rbac`, `volumes`, `secrets`, `addons`, `csp`, `domains`, `networks`, `info`, `users` — because the entry is baked into `host_vars` raw, which makes its top-level key the inventory path. A key no `meta/<topic>.yml` produces lands where nothing reads it and the override is silently discarded; `TestVariantTopLevelKeys` in [test_layout.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_layout.py) rejects it."
msgstr "ein YAML-Mapping, das die montierte Anwendungsnutzlast widerspiegelt, so dass es alles überschreiben kann, was unter `applications.<app>.<root>` (siehe) [layout.md](../../../design/role/services/layout.md). Jede Wurzel ist der Name einer `meta/` Thema — `services`, `server`, `rbac`, `volumes`, `secrets`, `addons`, `csp`, `domains`, `networks`, `info`, `users` - weil der Eingang in `host_vars` roh, was seinen Top-Level-Schlüssel zum Inventarpfad macht. Schlüsselnr. `meta/<topic>.yml` Land produziert, in dem es nichts liest und die Überschreibung stillschweigend verworfen wird; `TestVariantTopLevelKeys` in [test_layout.py](../../../../../tests/lint/ansible/roles/meta/test_layout.py) lehnt es ab."

