# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's `mod_admin` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejabberds `mod_admin` HTTP UI ist die einzige Playwright-testbare Oberfläche; XMPP-Client-Login selbst läuft über 5222/5269 und MUSS von einem XMPP-bewussten Client außerhalb der Playwright-Testschleife ausgeübt werden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd's only HTTP surface is `ejabberd_web_admin` on `/admin` (see [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2)). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. `acl.admin` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) therefore declares `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` and `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; the `guest` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Die einzige HTTP-Oberfläche von ejabberd ist `ejabberd_web_admin` am `/admin` (siehe) [`templates/configuration.yml.j2`](./templates/configuration.yml.j2). Es authentifiziert eine bloße JID gegen LDAP über HTTP Basic, so dass es keine Keycloak-Weiterleitung zum Folgen und keine In-App-Anmeldesteuerung zum Klicken gibt; Die Client-Authentifizierung selbst läuft über die Ports 5222/5269 und bleibt außerhalb der Playwright-Schleife, wie unter Watch Points angegeben. `acl.admin` listet zusätzlich nur die Administrator-JID auf, so dass der Web-Administrator jedes andere Konto direkt ablehnt. [`templates/playwright.env.j2`](./templates/playwright.env.j2) erklärt daher `PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true` und `PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true`; `guest` Persona und die baseline-erreichbarkeitsaussagen laufen bedingungslos."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI is the only Playwright-testable surface; XMPP client login itself runs over 5222/5269 and MUST be exercised by an XMPP-aware client outside the Playwright test loop."
msgstr "Ejabberd ``mod_admin`` HTTP UI ist die einzige Playwright-testbare Oberfläche; XMPP-Client-Login selbst läuft über 5222/5269 und MUSS von einem XMPP-bewussten Client außerhalb der Playwright-Testschleife ausgeübt werden."

# translated-by: libretranslate
msgid "ejabberd’s only HTTP surface is ``ejabberd_web_admin`` on ``/admin`` (see ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` persona and the baseline reachability assertions run unconditionally."
msgstr "Die einzige HTTP-Oberfläche von ejabberd ist ``ejabberd_web_admin`` am ``/admin`` (siehe ```templates/configuration.yml.j2`` <./templates/configuration.yml.j2>`__). It authenticates a bare JID against LDAP over HTTP Basic, so there is no Keycloak redirect to follow and no in-app logout control to click; client authentication itself runs over ports 5222/5269 and stays outside the Playwright loop, as noted under Watch Points. ``acl.admin`` additionally lists only the administrator JID, so the web admin refuses every other account outright. ```templates/playwright.env.j2`` <./templates/playwright.env.j2>`__ therefore declares ``PERSONA_BIBER_BLOCKED=true`` and ``PERSONA_ADMINISTRATOR_BLOCKED=true``; the ``guest`` Persona und die baseline-erreichbarkeitsaussagen laufen bedingungslos."

